     A                                      STOP-LOSS FOR CATASTROPHIC INJURIES-
     A                                       : To be eligible for the stop-loss-
     A                                       payment, the total audited charges-
     A                                       for the hospital inpatient stay fo-
     A                                      r treatment of major burns, severe -
     A                                      head and neurological injuries and -
     A                                      multiple system injuries, excluding-
     A                                       charges attributable to implantabl-
     A                                      es, must be at least Seventy Thousa-
     A                                      nd Dollars ($70,000.00), the minimu-
     A                                      m stop-loss threshold. If the total-
     A                                       audited charges for the hospital i-
     A                                      npatient stay equal or exceed the m-
     A                                      inimum stop-loss threshold, the tot-
     A                                      al audited charges are then multipl-
     A                                      ied by seventy percent (70%) to det-
     A                                      ermine the maximum allowable reimbu-
     A                                      rsement. For purposes of this calcu-
     A                                      lation, audited charges do not incl-
     A                                      ude any charges for implantables si-
     A                                      nce implantables are ')
     A                                  1  2HTML('reimbursed separately under G-
